            "notes": "[Tokki Slam](item_9e2b8c2e-ed2f-4ce9-8424-9c86664e3925) is the main highlight of this whole build! It won't give you super crazy value round 1, but scales quickly. \n\n[Refraction Armor](item_dd020802-8d00-489d-93e0-930b80e31144) is a good round 1 item if the enemy has any beam heroes, ([Zarya](hero_be6cc516-0b7a-4515-8472-f489f08993b0), [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0), [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed), etc), and not a bad item in general considering how much armor we'll have throughout the game.",
