            "notes": "[Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) and [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) help scale your [Tokki Slam](item_9e2b8c2e-ed2f-4ce9-8424-9c86664e3925) damage really well, and we won't be selling them. \n\n[Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) is just good in general because of our large armor pool, and [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) helps against a lot of the stuns which this build can struggle against, especially if the enemy knows what they're doing.",
