            "notes": "Lots of yapping here to explain the thought process regarding power choices\n\n## POWERS\nThere are a couple options for powers you could take here, though I prefer [Facetanking](item_f8af63d1-1fd4-4758-86ce-96f1ef7ea1ea), as it'll give you more uptime in between slams - especially since it was buffed to 50% of damage DMed. What's more is that it'll scale as the rounds go on too, as heroes do more and more damage.\n\nIf you're facing a lot of beam heroes, however, then this might only be a good power to take alongside [Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131), though, that'll mean you permanently have an item slot you can't replace with anything else, but that's just kinda what sucks in general about D.Va facing beam heroes. \n\n[Express Detonation](item_8da4cbad-78cb-4ebd-8bc4-8dc150afec95) (more kills) or [Party Protector](item_1ef9061d-cfa4-4f4e-a262-ab1012438e69) (safer re-mechs) would be my other choices in those scenarios, or if you're facing a bunch of melee characters. With [Express Detonation](item_8da4cbad-78cb-4ebd-8bc4-8dc150afec95) I'd recommend seeing if you can also afford [Dae-Hyun\u2019s Detonator](item_cf3e51e1-12c7-4d92-a68b-7742f98fe8fa), as the two combined can wrack up decent kills.\n\n[Ultrawide Matrix](item_403fe162-4a59-4a8e-8af9-5f83267228e8) is also a decent alternative to [Facetanking](item_f8af63d1-1fd4-4758-86ce-96f1ef7ea1ea) if you want longer DM uptime.\n\n## ITEMS\n[Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) and [Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) are both good items to add here, and whichever you don't get immediately you'll want to add next round.",
